WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:25.194
Poppy raced over to Dipper.

2
00:00:25.195 --> 00:00:28.376
"Tag!" said Poppy.

3
00:00:28.377 --> 00:00:32.254
"You're it!"

4
00:00:32.255 --> 00:00:36.424
Eddy and Jeb laughed.

5
00:00:36.425 --> 00:00:39.397
The friends were playing tag.

6
00:00:39.398 --> 00:00:45.336
Poppy drove away fast.

7
00:00:45.337 --> 00:00:48.003
Dipper shot toward Eddy.

8
00:00:48.004 --> 00:00:51.156
"Watch out, Eddy!" said Dipper.

9
00:00:51.157 --> 00:00:53.000
"I'm it!"

10
00:00:53.001 --> 00:00:55.900
Eddy's tires spun.

11
00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:57.628
He took off.

12
00:00:57.629 --> 00:01:02.180
Dipper tagged Jeb.

13
00:01:02.181 --> 00:01:05.171
Jeb sighed.

14
00:01:05.172 --> 00:01:07.926
"I'm it again."

15
00:01:07.927 --> 00:01:11.481
"You can't catch me!" Eddy shouted.

16
00:01:11.482 --> 00:01:16.334
He zoomed away from Jeb.

17
00:01:16.335 --> 00:01:19.294
Jeb rolled slowly.

18
00:01:19.295 --> 00:01:23.378
Poppy wasn't looking.

19
00:01:23.379 --> 00:01:25.250
Jeb tagged her.

20
00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:30.881
"You're it," said Jeb.

21
00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:34.259
"This is so much fun!" said Poppy.

22
00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:40.232
"I love playing tag!"

23
00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:43.546
Poppy chased Dipper.

24
00:01:43.547 --> 00:01:46.291
Dipper got away.

25
00:01:46.292 --> 00:01:49.226
Poppy chased Eddy.

26
00:01:49.227 --> 00:01:51.922
Eddy got away.

27
00:01:51.923 --> 00:01:56.407
Then Eddy saw something.

28
00:01:56.408 --> 00:02:00.638
"Um, Poppy," he said.

29
00:02:00.639 --> 00:02:06.040
"Something is wrong!"
